 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Syntactic structure of je ... desto",
     "texto": [
      "This correlative construction requires mastering two distinct clause orders:",
      "1. **First subordinate clause (with je + Komparativ)**: The connector **je** is immediately followed by the adjective or adverb in comparative degree, and the conjugated verb goes at the **absolute end**: **Je flexibler die Arbeitszeiten sind, ...**",
      "2. **Second main clause (with desto or umso + Komparativ)**: The block formed by **desto/umso + comparative** occupies the first position, so the conjugated verb moves to the obligatory **second syntactic position**: **... desto höher ist die Produktivität**.",
      "The verb must never be placed at the end in the «desto» part."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Subordinate clause (je + verb at end)",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Main clause (desto + verb in 2nd position)",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
     "filas": [
